            "review_title": "Review at Tung's Restaurant",
            "review_text": "SlowlyinAsia\nVancouver, Canada239 contributions\n0\nQuality food, Great Service, Friendly Atmosphere\nJul 2025 • Couples\nTung's is a small restaurant with a narrow space two doors from our hotel, as it turned out. We were lucky to find a table as it was full of patrons and guessing by the crowd was mostly tourists. We were given lots of time to study the menus and our server, Linh was extremely helpful. The food was outstanding and we were happy to sort of fall in through the door. Definitely eat there if you are near the Ben Thanh Market, HCMC.\nRead more\nWritten August 2, 2025",
